  "details": "Description\n\nwhen playing on a low-end pc such as a labtop or other device, when frames start to drop if your walking forward or back the imput will freeze forcing you to move in that direction untill the game is closed or until the game crashes.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nthe bug starts when playing with a high ping or a low-end pc, the only real way to stop yourself from walking in one direction only is by A: closing the game, or B: waiting for the endlag to stop and spam esc rapidly. if you arent fast enough it will persist, just to show how often this happens i am currently having this issue as i type about it.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-28_12-17-58.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_f3ded94f-00bc-4f84-b7dd-1cc14cf5e814/1/file)",
